        "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/7ac961b0c659b8ff9788dc0507b10bdb.avif?t=1788640658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras_big/7ac961b0c659b8ff9788dc0507b10bdb.avif?t=1788640658 width=1560 height=2180 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/82f5f308d5d101afa82920f3de502c70.avif?t=1788640658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras_big/82f5f308d5d101afa82920f3de502c70.webp?t=1788640658 width=1560 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your cult. Spread the mold. Watch the sky bloom with yellow eyes, click to decay beautifully. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/0dde0add21e93f3559e43f0ff0346955.poster.avif?t=1788640658\" width=618 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/0dde0add21e93f3559e43f0ff0346955.webm?t=1788640658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is a thin scab over the void.  <br>It festers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A yellow stain blooms at the edge of your vision. <br>Alive. Hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It whispers your name in the language of rot. <br>You <i>obey</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/c33c8824afe85e3f5d12c5c11b963fd7.poster.avif?t=1788640658\" width=618 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/c33c8824afe85e3f5d12c5c11b963fd7.webm?t=1788640658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cult of the Yellow King</i> is a cosmic horror idle game where you command a cult to summon the <i>Yellow King</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every click, you surrender another fragment of yourself: <i>memory, tongue, flesh</i>. Each prayer gnaws at your humanity. <br>Each sacrifice bleeds you hollow.<br> <br><strong>This is not a path to power, it is a descent into beautiful oblivion.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/a8adf01488f0829833a68db16631e8cd.poster.avif?t=1788640658\" width=618 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/a8adf01488f0829833a68db16631e8cd.webm?t=1788640658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IDLE MADNESS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generators whisper secrets that scar.  <br>Upgrades demand <i>teeth, skin, sanity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NARRATIVE OF UNMAKING </strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock fragmented tales of dread as you progress.  <br>Each milestone a fresh horror.   <br>Your skin crawls. Walls grow eyes.   <br>The sky bleeds yellow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRESTIGE THROUGH DAMNATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascend by shattering your progress.    </strong><br>Choose an elder curse. Begin again, deeper in devotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/d65680121a909a7ede5d76522e3bfb0e.poster.avif?t=1788640658\" width=618 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/d65680121a909a7ede5d76522e3bfb0e.webm?t=1788640658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOUNDS OF THE VOID </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black metal dirges by <i>Merhum</i>.   <br>Hymns for the end of reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE KING AWAITS </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mold has rooted in your throat.   <br>The stars blink shut.  <br><i>He</i> approaches…  <br>  <br><strong>Click, and let the beautiful decay consume you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/fc1d15bcc895990c00a2d8b748ef97bb.avif?t=1788640658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras_big/fc1d15bcc895990c00a2d8b748ef97bb.webp?t=1788640658 width=1560 height=166 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/82f5f308d5d101afa82920f3de502c70.avif?t=1788640658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras_big/82f5f308d5d101afa82920f3de502c70.webp?t=1788640658 width=1560 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your cult. Spread the mold. Watch the sky bloom with yellow eyes, click to decay beautifully. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/0dde0add21e93f3559e43f0ff0346955.poster.avif?t=1788640658\" width=618 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/0dde0add21e93f3559e43f0ff0346955.webm?t=1788640658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is a thin scab over the void.  <br>It festers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A yellow stain blooms at the edge of your vision. <br>Alive. Hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It whispers your name in the language of rot. <br>You <i>obey</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/c33c8824afe85e3f5d12c5c11b963fd7.poster.avif?t=1788640658\" width=618 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/c33c8824afe85e3f5d12c5c11b963fd7.webm?t=1788640658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cult of the Yellow King</i> is a cosmic horror idle game where you command a cult to summon the <i>Yellow King</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every click, you surrender another fragment of yourself: <i>memory, tongue, flesh</i>. Each prayer gnaws at your humanity. <br>Each sacrifice bleeds you hollow.<br> <br><strong>This is not a path to power, it is a descent into beautiful oblivion.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/a8adf01488f0829833a68db16631e8cd.poster.avif?t=1788640658\" width=618 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/a8adf01488f0829833a68db16631e8cd.webm?t=1788640658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IDLE MADNESS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generators whisper secrets that scar.  <br>Upgrades demand <i>teeth, skin, sanity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NARRATIVE OF UNMAKING </strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock fragmented tales of dread as you progress.  <br>Each milestone a fresh horror.   <br>Your skin crawls. Walls grow eyes.   <br>The sky bleeds yellow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRESTIGE THROUGH DAMNATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascend by shattering your progress.    </strong><br>Choose an elder curse. Begin again, deeper in devotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/d65680121a909a7ede5d76522e3bfb0e.poster.avif?t=1788640658\" width=618 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/d65680121a909a7ede5d76522e3bfb0e.webm?t=1788640658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOUNDS OF THE VOID </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black metal dirges by <i>Merhum</i>.   <br>Hymns for the end of reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE KING AWAITS </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mold has rooted in your throat.   <br>The stars blink shut.  <br><i>He</i> approaches…  <br>  <br><strong>Click, and let the beautiful decay consume you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras/fc1d15bcc895990c00a2d8b748ef97bb.avif?t=1788640658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928030/extras_big/fc1d15bcc895990c00a2d8b748ef97bb.webp?t=1788640658 width=1560 height=166 /></span></p>",
